# MS Sans Serif/Regular -- cmap for Regular.png (see docs/framebuf/bmfont.md)
# Cells follow Windows-1252 from 0x20; only the drawn cells are mapped.
U+0020..U+007E  0     # printable ASCII
U+00A0          0     # NBSP shares space
U+00A1..U+00FF  129   # Latin-1 Supplement
U+20AC          96    # euro sign (cp1252 0x80)
